0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "I want to know how to set the `base_mode` and `custom_mode` in HEARTBEAT.\n`HEARTBEAT (0) \nField Name\nbase_mode, \ncustom_mode`\n\nI am working on a vehicle side and using Server plugins. I have the following process:\n`QGC -> Send \"Takeoff\" command -> Vehicle take off\nQGC <- Send \"Custom_mode\" with \"AUTO:TAKEOFF\" <- Vehicle\nQGC show \"AUTO:TAKEOFF\"`\n\nBut `set_custom_mode()` is private API in MAVSDK.\n`void ServerComponentImpl::send_heartbeat()\n{\n\u2026\nmavlink_address.component_id == MAV_COMP_ID_AUTOPILOT1 ? _base_mode.load() : 0,\nmavlink_address.component_id == MAV_COMP_ID_AUTOPILOT1 ? _custom_mode.load() : 0,\n\u2026\n}\nclass ActionServerImpl : public ServerPluginImplBase {\nprivate:\nvoid set_base_mode(uint8_t base_mode);\nvoid set_custom_mode(uint32_t custom_mode);\n}`\nAnd I tried `mavlink_msg_set_mode_pack_chan()` to send the message but it doesn\u2019t work.\n\nSo I modified the MAVSDK in `action_server.cpp`.\n`void ActionServer::set_base_mode(uint8_t base_mode) const\n{\n_impl->set_base_mode(base_mode);\n}\nvoid ActionServer::set_custom_mode(uint32_t custom_mode) const\n{\n_impl->set_custom_mode(custom_mode);\n}`\nAdditionally, `add_capablilities()` also have the same problem, so I modified them as follows.\n`Sever_component.cpp`\n`void ServerComponent::add_capablilities(uint64_t capablilities)\n{\n\tif (_impl) {\n\t\timpl->add_capabilities(capablilities);\n\t}\n}`\nI want to use MAVSDK without modifying it. I want to know if there is another way.", "closed_by": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2514/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2514/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": "completed", "pinned_comment": null}, "comments": [{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/2670033164", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2514#issuecomment-2670033164", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2514", "id": 2670033164, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s6fJXkM", "user": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2025-02-19T23:50:06Z", "updated_at": "2025-02-19T23:50:06Z", "body": "We should implement standard flight modes in MAVSDK which will make this easier/possible.\n\nSee: https://mavlink.io/en/services/standard_modes.html", "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/2670033164/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/2672415420", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2514#issuecomment-2672415420", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2514", "id": 2672415420, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s6fSdK8", "user": {"login": "souljt01", "id": 43978319, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjQzOTc4MzE5", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43978319?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/souljt01", "html_url": "https://github.com/souljt01", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/souljt01/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/souljt01/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/souljt01/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/souljt01/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/souljt01/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/souljt01/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/souljt01/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/souljt01/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/souljt01/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2025-02-20T19:01:52Z", "updated_at": "2025-02-20T19:01:52Z", "body": "Thanks for your reply. I'm trying to implement `MAVSDK` on my vehicle and I want to make my vehicle controllable with `QGC`. I'm facing an issue where `GCS` is not displaying the flight mode transmitted from the vehicle.\nI can see that mavsdk is sending a heartbeat below.\n```\nvoid ServerComponentImpl::send_heartbeat()\n{\n    queue_message([&](MavlinkAddress mavlink_address, uint8_t channel) {\n        mavlink_message_t message;\n        mavlink_msg_heartbeat_pack_chan(\n            get_own_system_id(),\n            mavlink_address.component_id,\n            channel,\n            &message,\n            _mavsdk_impl.get_mav_type(),\n            mavlink_address.component_id == MAV_COMP_ID_AUTOPILOT1 ? MAV_AUTOPILOT_GENERIC :\n                                                                     MAV_AUTOPILOT_INVALID,\n            mavlink_address.component_id == MAV_COMP_ID_AUTOPILOT1 ? _base_mode.load() : 0,\n            mavlink_address.component_id == MAV_COMP_ID_AUTOPILOT1 ? _custom_mode.load() : 0,\n            get_system_status());\n        return message;\n    });\n}\n```\n`_base_mode`, `_custom_mode`, and related functions are also private and cannot be accessed from my vehicle.\nSo I tried this on my vehicle:\n\n1. Send `MAV_CMD_DO_SET_MODE` with `base_mode` and `custom_mode` in the vehicle, but `QGC` does not display the flight mode sent by the vehicle.\n\n2. Send `HEARTBEAT` message in the vehicle. However, `QGC` displays the flight mode sent by the vehicle, but it changes to the `HEARTBEAT` message sent by `MAVSDK` itself.\n\nSo, what I would like to suggest is to change the following functions to public.\n```\nclass ActionServerImpl : public ServerPluginImplBase {\nprivate:\nvoid set_base_mode(uint8_t base_mode);\nuint8_t get_base_mode() const;\n\nvoid set_custom_mode(uint32_t custom_mode);\nuint32_t get_custom_mode() const;\n}\n```", "author_association": "NONE", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/2672415420/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/2716058009", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2514#issuecomment-2716058009", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2514", "id": 2716058009, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s6h48GZ", "user": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2025-03-12T00:31:11Z", "updated_at": "2025-03-12T00:32:03Z", "body": "Are you also intercepting outgoing messages to prevent MAVSDK from sending conflicting heartbeats?\n\n> So, what I would like to suggest is to change the following functions to public.\n\nNo way. I don't think custom PX4 hacky internals should leak through the API.\n\nAs said, we need to 